---
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#1E100A] text-[#FAF6F0] relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle warm ambient background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[#E34A6F] opacity-10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    
    <!-- Small Strawberry-Pink Quotation Mark -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#2C1810] border border-[#E34A6F]/30 text-[#E34A6F] font-serif text-4xl mb-8 shadow-inner">
      “
    </div>

    <!-- Artist Philosophy & Core Statement -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[#E34A6F] block">
        Atelier Credo & Client Reflections
      </span>

      <blockquote class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#FFFDF9] font-normal leading-relaxed italic">
          “We do not mass produce; we craft one-of-a-kind sweet heirlooms for the moments you cherish forever. A cake should be as unforgettable to taste as it is breathtaking to behold.”
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#FAF6F0]">[Founder & Sugar Artist]</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#8E7A70] tracking-wider uppercase mt-1">CakeyTales Atelier</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Client Note Frame -->
    <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#2C1810]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#4A3328] shadow-xl text-left">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-[#4A3328]">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#E34A6F]">
          Client Celebration Note
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#8E7A70]">Summer Nuptials • Private Estate</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#D4C3BA] font-light italic leading-relaxed">
        “CakeyTales transformed our wedding reception with a quiet, breathtaking elegance that our guests still talk about months later. The restrained sugar floral detailing, the delicate luster, and the lemon elderflower layers were absolute poetry.”
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#8E7A70]">
        <span class="text-[#FAF6F0] font-medium">[Client Note — Summer Wedding Commission]</span>
        <span class="text-[#E34A6F]">✦ Bespoke 4-Tier</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Atelier Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto border-t border-[#331C13] mt-14">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#FDF1CE]">Pure Scratch</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#8E7A70] mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Unadulterated Real Butter & Fruit</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#FDF1CE]">Singular Art</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#8E7A70] mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Never Duplicated Twice</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#FDF1CE]">White-Glove</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#8E7A70] mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Artist On-Site Venue Assembly</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
